          <p class="text-gray-600 m-0">
            If this is your first time trimming your back, start with a longer guide comb — 9mm to 12mm — even if you think you want it shorter. You can always run a second pass at a lower setting once you see how the length looks, but you cannot undo an overly aggressive first pass.
          </p>
