          <p class="text-gray-600 m-0">
            Unlike shaving, most guide-comb trimming works best on completely dry hair. Wet hair tends to clump and can feed unevenly into a guide comb, leading to patchy results. Shower first if you like, but towel off and let your skin fully air-dry before trimming.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-[#1E90FF] p-8 my-8 rounded-r-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Step 3: Work Against the Grain, in Overlapping Passes</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 m-0">
