            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Who should use a trimmer instead of a shaver for back hair?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
